cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EEG Layout Lab: Local-First Design and Evaluation of Compact Multi-Region EEG Electrode Layouts"
message: "If you use EEG Layout Lab or its evaluation protocols in academic work, please cite this software."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shen
    given-names: Yiming
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Yi
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-11-26"
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - EEG
  - electrode layout optimization
  - finite element head model
  - source localization
  - wearable BCI
  - neuroengineering
abstract: >-
  EEG Layout Lab designs, evaluates, and compares compact multi-region EEG electrode
  layouts (8 to 64 channels) against a standard 64-electrode whole-head reference on
  realistic finite-element head models, quantifying field reconstruction retention,
  lower-tail bipolar sensitivity retention, and source localization utility.
